              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arik’ Umwitsa, ari we Mpwemu Yera, uwo Data azorungika mw izina ryanje, ni we azobigisha vyose, kand’ azobibutsa ivyo nababariye vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
